<title>SPAIN: BCH cuts prime by 50 b.p. to 8.75 pct.</title>
<headline>BCH cuts prime by 50 b.p. to 8.75 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Banco Central Hispano it lowered its prime rate by 50 basis points to 8.75 percent effective on Monday.</p>
<p>BCH also said that it would lower other rates during the course of the morning.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
